{"seq":1,"slug":"homelab-getting-started","title":"Homelab 入门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/self-hosted-services/homelab-getting-started","wordCount":1012,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"homelab-入门\">Homelab 入门</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Homelab 是一套运行在你家中的服务器基础设施，用于托管个人服务、学习技术、以及将数据主权从云服务商手中收回。2026 年，搭建 Homelab 的门槛已降至历史最低：一台 Raspberry Pi 5 仅需 80 美元，Mac Mini M4 在 5-7W 的功耗下提供 16GB 内存和 Apple Silicon 性能，Docker 让部署变成一条命令。本文从硬件选型、操作系统配置到网络规划，提供从零开始的完整决策框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"为什么自托管\">为什么自托管</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动机</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>量化收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据主权</td>\n<td>数据在你的硬盘上，不在别人的服务器</td>\n<td>消除平台锁定风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本节约</td>\n<td>一次硬件投入替代持续订阅费</td>\n<td>1 年内回本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐私保护</td>\n<td>无数据挖掘、无 AI 训练</td>\n<td>合规简化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技能提升</td>\n<td>真实运维经验比证书更有价值</td>\n<td>职业加分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义自由</td>\n<td>想跑什么跑什么，想改什么改什么</td>\n<td>无限灵活性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"硬件选型决策树\">硬件选型决策树</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;选型起点&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;预算范围?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;&lt; 1000 RMB&quot;| C[&quot;Raspberry Pi 5 8GB&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;1000-3000 RMB&quot;| D[&quot;Mini PC / 二手 NUC&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;3000-5000 RMB&quot;| E[&quot;Mac Mini M4&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;&gt; 5000 RMB&quot;| F[&quot;专用服务器 / NAS&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;适合: 5-8 个轻量服务&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;适合: 10-20 个服务 + 本地 AI&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;适合: 全栈 + 静音 + 高性能&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[&quot;适合: 大存储 + 虚拟化&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"选型起点\"] --&gt; B{\"预算范围?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"&lt; 1000 RMB\"| C[\"Raspberry Pi 5 8GB\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"1000-3000 RMB\"| D[\"Mini PC / 二手 NUC\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"3000-5000 RMB\"| E[\"Mac Mini M4\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"&gt; 5000 RMB\"| F[\"专用服务器 / NAS\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"适合: 5-8 个轻量服务\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"适合: 10-20 个服务 + 本地 AI\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"适合: 全栈 + 静音 + 高性能\"]\n    F --&gt; F1[\"适合: 大存储 + 虚拟化\"]</pre><h3 id=\"三档方案对比\">三档方案对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Raspberry Pi 5</th>\n<th>Mini PC (N100)</th>\n<th>Mac Mini M4</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价格</td>\n<td>~600 RMB</td>\n<td>~1500 RMB</td>\n<td>~4000 RMB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU</td>\n<td>ARM Cortex-A76 4核</td>\n<td>Intel N100 4核</td>\n<td>Apple M4 10核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAM</td>\n<td>8GB</td>\n<td>16-32GB</td>\n<td>16-24GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功耗</td>\n<td>5-15W</td>\n<td>15-30W</td>\n<td>5-7W 空闲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪音</td>\n<td>静音（被动散热）</td>\n<td>低噪</td>\n<td>静音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Docker 兼容</td>\n<td>ARM 镜像（90%覆盖）</td>\n<td>x86（100%覆盖）</td>\n<td>ARM 镜像（95%覆盖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>MicroSD + USB SSD</td>\n<td>NVMe SSD</td>\n<td>内置 SSD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合</td>\n<td>入门学习、轻量服务</td>\n<td>主力 Homelab</td>\n<td>高性能全栈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"方案一-raspberry-pi-5-入门\">方案一：Raspberry Pi 5 入门</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 烧录系统（使用 Raspberry Pi Imager）&#10;# 选择 Raspberry Pi OS Lite (64-bit) — 无桌面，纯 CLI&#10;&#10;# 2. 首次启动配置&#10;sudo raspi-config&#10;# → System Options → Hostname: homelab&#10;# → Interface Options → SSH: Enable&#10;# → Performance Options → GPU Memory: 16 (最小化)&#10;&#10;# 3. 系统更新&#10;sudo apt update &amp;&amp; sudo apt upgrade -y&#10;&#10;# 4. 安装 Docker&#10;curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | sh&#10;sudo usermod -aG docker $USER&#10;&#10;# 5. 安装 Docker Compose&#10;sudo apt install docker-compose-plugin -y&#10;&#10;# 6. 验证&#10;docker --version  # Docker 27.x+&#10;docker compose version  # v2.x\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 烧录系统（使用 Raspberry Pi Imager）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 选择 Raspberry Pi OS Lite (64-bit) — 无桌面，纯 CLI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 首次启动配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> raspi-config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># → System Options → Hostname: homelab</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># → Interface Options → SSH: Enable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># → Performance Options → GPU Memory: 16 (最小化)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 系统更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upgrade</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. 安装 Docker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fsSL</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://get.docker.com</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> usermod</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -aG</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $USER</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 5. 安装 Docker Compose</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker-compose-plugin</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 6. 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --version</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # Docker 27.x+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # v2.x</span></span></code></pre></div><p>外接 SSD 作为数据盘（MicroSD 不适合数据库工作负载）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 挂载 USB SSD&#10;sudo mkdir /mnt/data&#10;sudo mount /dev/sda1 /mnt/data&#10;echo &#39;/dev/sda1 /mnt/data ext4 defaults,nofail 0 2&#39; | sudo tee -a /etc/fstab&#10;&#10;# Docker 数据目录迁移到 SSD&#10;sudo systemctl stop docker&#10;sudo mv /var/lib/docker /mnt/data/docker&#10;sudo ln -s /mnt/data/docker /var/lib/docker&#10;sudo systemctl start docker\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 挂载 USB SSD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /mnt/data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mount</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/sda1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /mnt/data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/dev/sda1 /mnt/data ext4 defaults,nofail 0 2'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tee</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/fstab</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Docker 数据目录迁移到 SSD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> systemctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stop</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/lib/docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /mnt/data/docker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ln</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /mnt/data/docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/lib/docker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> systemctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方案二-mini-pc-主力部署\">方案二：Mini PC 主力部署</h3><p>Intel N100 Mini PC（如 Beelink S12 Pro）是 2026 年 Homelab 的性价比之王：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 Ubuntu Server 24.04 LTS（USB 启动盘安装）&#10;&#10;# 基础配置&#10;sudo hostnamectl set-hostname homelab&#10;sudo timedatectl set-timezone Asia/Shanghai&#10;&#10;# 安装 Docker Engine 最新版&#10;curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com -o get-docker.sh&#10;sudo sh get-docker.sh&#10;sudo usermod -aG docker $USER&#10;&#10;# 创建数据目录结构&#10;sudo mkdir -p /opt/homelab/{configs,data,backups}&#10;sudo chown -R $USER:$USER /opt/homelab&#10;&#10;# 启用自动安全更新&#10;sudo apt install unattended-upgrades -y&#10;sudo dpkg-reconfigure -plow unattended-upgrades\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 Ubuntu Server 24.04 LTS（USB 启动盘安装）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 基础配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hostnamectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set-hostname</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> homelab</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> timedatectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set-timezone</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Asia/Shanghai</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 Docker Engine 最新版</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fsSL</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://get.docker.com</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get-docker.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get-docker.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> usermod</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -aG</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $USER</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建数据目录结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/homelab/{configs,data,backups}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> chown</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -R</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $USER</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$USER </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/opt/homelab</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启用自动安全更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> unattended-upgrades</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dpkg-reconfigure</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -plow</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> unattended-upgrades</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方案三-mac-mini-m4-高性能方案\">方案三：Mac Mini M4 高性能方案</h3><p>Mac Mini M4 以极低功耗提供强大性能，但 macOS 不原生支持 Docker——需要 OrbStack：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 OrbStack（Mac 上最优的 Docker 运行时）&#10;brew install orbstack&#10;&#10;# OrbStack 优势 vs Docker Desktop:&#10;# - 启动速度快 10 倍&#10;# - 内存占用低 50%&#10;# - 原生 ARM 性能，无虚拟化开销&#10;# - 自动端口转发和 DNS&#10;&#10;# 数据目录&#10;mkdir -p ~/homelab/{configs,data,backups}&#10;&#10;# 验证&#10;docker run hello-world\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 OrbStack（Mac 上最优的 Docker 运行时）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> orbstack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># OrbStack 优势 vs Docker Desktop:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># - 启动速度快 10 倍</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># - 内存占用低 50%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># - 原生 ARM 性能，无虚拟化开销</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># - 自动端口转发和 DNS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 数据目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/homelab/{configs,data,backups}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hello-world</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"存储规划\">存储规划</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n<th>容量建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>系统盘</td>\n<td>NVMe SSD</td>\n<td>256GB+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据盘</td>\n<td>SATA SSD</td>\n<td>1-2TB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>备份盘</td>\n<td>外置 HDD / NAS</td>\n<td>4TB+</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>系统和数据分离</strong>：系统崩溃不影响数据</li>\n<li><strong>3-2-1 备份</strong>：3 份副本、2 种介质、1 份异地</li>\n<li><strong>加密</strong>：对敏感数据使用 LUKS（Linux）或 FileVault（Mac）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"网络规划\">网络规划</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"互联网&#10;  │&#10;  ▼&#10;[路由器] ─── 主网络（家庭设备）&#10;  │&#10;  ├── VLAN 10: Homelab（服务器 + 管理）&#10;  └── VLAN 20: IoT（智能家居设备）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>互联网</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[路由器] ─── 主网络（家庭设备）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ├── VLAN 10: Homelab（服务器 + 管理）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └── VLAN 20: IoT（智能家居设备）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>基础网络配置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>为 Homelab 设备设置静态 IP（或 DHCP 保留）</li>\n<li>如有支持 VLAN 的交换机，将 Homelab 和 IoT 隔离</li>\n<li>UPS 保护（即使便宜的 UPS 也比突然断电强）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"安全加固清单\">安全加固清单</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SSH 密钥认证</td>\n<td>禁用密码登录</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>防火墙</td>\n<td>仅开放必要端口</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动更新</td>\n<td>unattended-upgrades</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非 root 运行</td>\n<td>Docker 用户组</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监控</td>\n<td>Uptime Kuma</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>备份验证</td>\n<td>定期恢复测试</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志审计</td>\n<td>定期检查 auth.log</td>\n<td>建议</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"启动顺序建议\">启动顺序建议</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Phase 1（第一周）: 基础设施&#10;  └── Docker + Portainer（管理界面）+ Uptime Kuma（监控）&#10;&#10;Phase 2（第二周）: 核心服务&#10;  └── Vaultwarden（密码）+ Nextcloud（文件）+ Pi-hole（DNS）&#10;&#10;Phase 3（第三周+）: 高级服务&#10;  └── Immich（照片）+ Paperless（文档）+ n8n（自动化）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Phase 1（第一周）: 基础设施</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └── Docker + Portainer（管理界面）+ Uptime Kuma（监控）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Phase 2（第二周）: 核心服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └── Vaultwarden（密码）+ Nextcloud（文件）+ Pi-hole（DNS）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Phase 3（第三周+）: 高级服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └── Immich（照片）+ Paperless（文档）+ n8n（自动化）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"成本对比\">成本对比</h3><p>月度云服务 vs 自托管一次性投入：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>服务</th>\n<th>云月费</th>\n<th>自托管方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>密码管理</td>\n<td>¥25/月</td>\n<td>Vaultwarden（免费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>云存储 100GB</td>\n<td>¥40/月</td>\n<td>Nextcloud（免费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>照片备份</td>\n<td>¥30/月</td>\n<td>Immich（免费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VPN</td>\n<td>¥50/月</td>\n<td>WireGuard（免费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>年度总计</strong></td>\n<td><strong>¥1,740</strong></td>\n<td>硬件 ¥1,500（一次）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Portainer</td>\n<td>Docker 管理 GUI</td>\n<td>适合不想纯 CLI 管理的用户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Uptime Kuma</td>\n<td>服务监控</td>\n<td>美观的状态页面 + 告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Watchtower</td>\n<td>自动更新容器</td>\n<td>定时拉取最新镜像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dockge</td>\n<td>Compose 管理</td>\n<td>比 Portainer 更轻量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Homepage</td>\n<td>仪表盘</td>\n<td>聚合所有服务入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scrutiny</td>\n<td>硬盘健康</td>\n<td>S.M.A.R.T 监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>Homelab 的核心不是硬件有多强，而是你对自己数据和服务的掌控力。从一台 Raspberry Pi 开始，跑起第一个 Docker 容器，感受&quot;我的数据在我的硬盘上&quot;的踏实感——这比任何高配方案都更重要。600 元的 Pi 5 加一块 SSD 就能承载密码管理、文件同步、照片备份三大核心服务，比一年的云订阅费还便宜。硬件可以按需升级，但自托管的习惯和技能一旦建立，就是终身受益的投资。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Homelab 入门","id":"homelab-入门"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么自托管","id":"为什么自托管"},{"level":3,"text":"硬件选型决策树","id":"硬件选型决策树"},{"level":3,"text":"三档方案对比","id":"三档方案对比"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"方案一：Raspberry Pi 5 入门","id":"方案一-raspberry-pi-5-入门"},{"level":3,"text":"方案二：Mini PC 主力部署","id":"方案二-mini-pc-主力部署"},{"level":3,"text":"方案三：Mac Mini M4 高性能方案","id":"方案三-mac-mini-m4-高性能方案"},{"level":3,"text":"存储规划","id":"存储规划"},{"level":3,"text":"网络规划","id":"网络规划"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"安全加固清单","id":"安全加固清单"},{"level":3,"text":"启动顺序建议","id":"启动顺序建议"},{"level":3,"text":"成本对比","id":"成本对比"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"个人数据仓库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/sqlite-personal-apps/personal-data-warehouse"},"next":{"title":"Docker Compose 服务栈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/self-hosted-services/docker-compose-stack"}}